[01:02.06] From morning to night, I stayed out of sight
[01:11.21] Didn't recognize I'd become
[01:18.48] No more than alive, I'd barely survive
[01:27.27] In a word overrun
[01:33.09] Won't hear a sound (he's curled into the corner)
[01:37.41] From my mouth (but still the screen is flickering)
[01:41.10] I've spent too long (with an endless stream of garbage)
[01:45.02] On the inside out (curse the place)
[01:48.99] My skin is cold (in a sea of random images)
[01:52.86] To the human touch (the self-destructing animal)
[01:56.82] This bleeding heart's (waiting for the waves)
[02:00.83] Not beating much (to break)
[02:05.55] I murmured a vow of silence and now
[02:14.11] I don't even hear when I think aloud
[02:21.11] Extinguished by light, I turn on the night
[02:29.84] Wear its darkness with an empty smile
[02:36.03] 
[02:53.40] I'm creeping back to life
[02:56.84] My nervous system all awry
[03:02.12] I'm wearing the inside out
[03:06.72] 
[03:40.17] Look at him now
[03:43.51] He's paler somehow
[03:47.19] 
[03:50.13] But he's coming round
[03:55.42] He's starting to choke
[03:58.33] It's been so long since he spoke
[04:03.91] Well, he can have the words right from my mouth
[04:10.04] And with these words, I can see
[04:17.89] Clear through the clouds that covered me
[04:25.70] Just give it time then speak my name
[04:33.48] Now we can hear ourselves again
[04:41.48] I'm holding out (he's standing on the threshold)
[04:45.75] For the day (caught in fiery anger)
[04:49.35] When all the clouds (and hurled into the furnace)
[04:53.29] Have blown away (he'll curse the place)
[04:57.15] I'm with you now (he's torn in all directions)
[05:01.01] Can speak your name (and still the screen is flickering)
[05:04.90] Now we can hear (waiting for the flames)
[05:08.96] Ourselves again (to break)
[05:11.02] 